b-49f1-a44b-2431b1f8a127","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実際には public repository であれば GitHub runner であっても無料ですね","ts":"1624448873.091800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zlt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44404db7-c63e-401c-8559-3f27df46b479","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"原文はこれでした。\n\u0026gt; GitHub Actions usage is free for both public repositories and self-hosted runners.\nboth A and Bってつまりor条件ですかね？ \u003c#CS1NKB9B2|english\u003e 案件。。","ts":"1624448787.091200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RfBr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55b55cb6-870a-46f8-bfda-8ae7927a1d1c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"原文で読んだら分かったりするんですかね","ts":"1624447998.091000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T+To"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1eec8eab-c04c-4f53-ad93-df51673bc6bc","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"パブリックおよびself hostedは無料というふうに読めますね\nつまりor条件","ts":"1624447979.090700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qKx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6496ff61-c545-4ecc-a6dc-26162a397598","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"GitLabも同様ですね","ts":"1624447795.089700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vUx/U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"875f0373-00b0-4e32-a97a-387b10690cb9","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"```パブリックリポジトリ, GitHub runner: 無料\nパブリックリポジトリ, セルフホストランナー: 無料\nプライベートリポジトリ, GitHub runner: 有料\nプライベートリポジトリ, セルフホストランナー: 無料```\nということ。。？ ちょっとor条件なのかand条件なのか一瞬分からなかった。","ts":"1624447637.089200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lxt2n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22160fc1-89c6-45b9-9cea-ad1f1e01f202","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://docs.github.com/ja/billing/managing-billing-for-github-actions/about-billing-for-github-actions\u003e\n\u0026gt; GitHub Actions パブリックリポジトリとセルフホストランナーでは、どちらも利用は無料です。\n無料?","ts":"1624447492.088900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U=CWO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85aa516f-c865-442c-a4f8-fc840d286624","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"プライベートレポジトリでself hosted runnerを使うときの課金ってどうなるんでしょうか？","ts":"1624447435.088500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GG3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"078c9895-a202-48c1-959f-54f08e2d4e35","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"github actions、runner を self-hosted できるので、外部インスタンスで走らせたくない場合も安心","ts":"1624447315.088200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u=r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d120e093-9fce-4da1-911f-94ee62ac1705","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://docs.github.com/en/actions/guides/creating-postgresql-service-containers\u003e\nPG は GitHub Action で立てたことないけど、割とサクッと立てられそうなのかな。","ts":"1624447245.087300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wls67"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df972f33-0565-4157-847e-d5cf98596ae4","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"(GitHub Actions入れていいか上司に相談するか...())","ts":"1624447159.086700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5oVd4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b151fb79-39ec-4dbb-8a99-6417695e79d0","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あ、pytestを使ってるんですが、デバッグ時には --ff オプション使ってるので、詰まってるときは1テストしか走りません。\nやっぱり全部走らせるのはCIですよねー。","ts":"1624447097.086300","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1624447111.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lr=s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a89ddf0-d1be-41ef-a8db-3c8bf77ac094","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"そうですねぇ。自分は基本変更した箇所と関係あるやつだけローカルで走らせて全部は CI ですねぇ(先にも書いた通り遅いので)\n初期データ突っ込む fixture のロードが遅いんすよね","ts":"1624446958.086000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dea"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd1f6a04-648c-4107-803f-7f6168c30b65","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あ、毎コミットっていうのはcommit hookじゃなくて手動make testです。\n意図せず壊れてるのとか見つかって結構助かってます。\nただ、全部走るのはたしかにオーバーキル感があるので選別するか。。","ts":"1624446953.085800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GQL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"846483be-ff64-46d5-b6bb-a1be0a9bbada","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"逆に絶対に動いてほしいcommitもある。","ts":"1624446861.083700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PFh0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09bf1a05-6654-4eec-bdd9-dfae669068d9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"んー動かないとわかってるcommitもありますからね。","ts":"1624446853.083300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lNPb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c0d7d54-1e02-464f-a527-919a45d232a7","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"lint が走るのはわかるけど…","ts":"1624446824.082200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6NQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f340d665-e491-4264-bc65-4a6880001dc4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"どっちかっていうとシナリオ優先的なテストなんですけども。","ts":"1624446785.081700","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1624446802.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7ZV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"948676e6-2a9c-47e4-8b91-d623c974f574","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"毎コミット、ローカルで unit test 走るのはちょっとオーバーキル気味な気が…","ts":"1624446784.081600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x8u=q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cefa91da-b1b6-4f82-8c81-341e787fed1a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちなみにCIでのテストで、データを巧妙に設計してテストケースを同時に確かめたりするのは、パラレルで走らせるために重要だったりします。","ts":"1624446768.081000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bHUc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7d0848a-1357-4310-bf9b-78cab481ded3","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"テストが完全に負債化してて手をつけたいけど、つけられない :gunnyari:","ts":"1624446747.080000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"grin","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3za"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1405ef32-2290-417c-9742-116f7c7b4181","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"mysql でパーティションいっぱいあるテーブルの truncate に時間がかかって辛いことがありました","ts":"1624446731.079100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fUF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"effd6433-d56d-4264-9ee1-0658b5628721","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"CIは10分くらいまでは許すかな。30分はキツイ。\n\n\nユニットテストは1パッケージにつき5秒以内くらいで終わってほしい。","ts":"1624446703.078100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1624446719.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U78A6ESHM","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z=Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb486f9b-531d-4bad-b130-34d09b1191af","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"毎コミットローカルで走るので早さは重要なんですよね。\nCIで回すやつとローカルで回すやつを選別するというのもよさそうですが。","ts":"1624446689.077400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P0OT1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccb7b167-f02c-4efe-926e-7588afd5f1b7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"truncateによるリセット\u0026amp;再データ投入は、スキーマ作り直すよりは早いはず。","ts":"1624446685.077100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dudy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"076aac9b-4185-43c4-8d45-6336257fc1fa","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"drop schemaじゃなくて全テーブルtruncateですかね。\nちょっとそれで明日試してみようかな。","ts":"1624446645.076000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sH3i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03e2dc50-26ca-41b6-a69d-f1b392a0ca4b","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"多分毒されてる(いま 10 分越え)","ts":"1624446637.075600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["UD1FQV38V","UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HPUm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6beec774-42c3-4819-90b1-3f33601e2c09","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"A. スペックで殴る:bram:","ts":"1624446635.075500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EeqZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b5c0f61-d18b-47e7-bfac-0e4cfb63565b","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"めっちゃ早いって思っちゃうw","ts":"1624446622.074600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GHm/0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e91df4aa-eab3-4de8-b166-8d13995d1d8e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"fixtureでできるのは分かるんですが、遅いなぁ。。と()\nテストで1分越えてくると私の許容範囲外なんですよね。今は2分弱かかってます。","ts":"1624446596.073700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_